{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SgZfg8X6x6m5AJXADKsmYD","type":"tool_result","content":"# .anchor/ — Anchor R&D per-project store\r\n\r\nThis directory is created and managed by Anchor's R&D control surface. Each\r\nregistered project gets an isolated namespace at:\r\n\r\n    .anchor/projects/<project-id>/\r\n        research/      planning/      build/      deliverables/      jobs/\r\n\r\nMultiple projects may share one folder; each has its own `<project-id>` subtree,\r\nso their stores never collide.\r\n\r\n## Tracking policy (C9 git-trackable vs C10 no-leak)\r\n\r\n- **Tracked (C9):** small JSON *pointer-records* that index efforts/versions —\r\n  these are committed so effort history is durable across restarts.\r\n- **Ignored (C10):** raw job logs, large generated artifacts (PDF), and any\r\n  `raw/` payloads that could carry absolute paths, tokens, or personal data.\r\n  The distribution build (Wave 8) additionally scans for and refuses to ship\r\n  anything under `.anchor/`.\r\n\r\nSee the sibling `.gitignore` for the exact rules.\r\n---PROJECTS---\nC:/Users/john/AppData/Local/Temp/pytest-of-john/pytest-2183/test_grass_column_renders_in_w0/P/.anchor/projects/:\n0fce53402ebe4a3d8cab7854ce548c60\n\nC:/Users/john/AppData/Local/Temp/pytest-of-john/pytest-2183/test_grass_column_renders_in_w0/P/.anchor/projects/0fce53402ebe4a3d8cab7854ce548c60:\nbuild\ndeliverables\ndiscovery.json\ngrass\njobs\nplanning\nresearch\n\nC:/Users/john/AppData/Local/Temp/pytest-of-john/pytest-2183/test_grass_column_renders_in_w0/P/.anchor/projects/0fce53402ebe4a3d8cab7854ce548c60/build:\n\nC:/Users/john/AppData/Local/Temp/pytest-of-john/pytest-2183/test_grass_column_renders_in_w0/P/.anchor/projects/0fce53402ebe4a3d8cab7854ce548c60/deliverables:\n\nC:/Users/john/AppData/Local/Temp/pytest-of-john/pytest-2183/test_grass_column_renders_in_w0/P/.anchor/projects/0fce53402ebe4a3d8cab7854ce548c60/grass:\n\nC:/Users/john/AppData/Local/Temp/pytest-of-john/